      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h3 id="learnTitle">📚 Leson finans</h3>
        <p id="learnText">Aprann baz bidjè, echanj lajan ak sekirite finansye.</p>
        <a href="#learn" id="learnLink">Aprann plis →</a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section id="converter">
      <h2 class="section-title" id="calcHeading">Konvètisè goud ak dola</h2>
      <div class="card converter">
        <p id="rateHelp">Antre to echanj la: konbyen goud pou 1 dola ameriken?</p>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="rate" id="rateLabel">To echanj (HTG pou 1 USD)</label>
          <input id="rate" type="number" min="0.0001" step="any" value="130">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="amount" id="amountLabel">Montan</label>
          <input id="amount" type="number" min="0" step="any" value="100">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="direction" id="directionLabel">Sans konvèsyon</label>
          <select id="direction">
            <option value="usd">USD → HTG</option>
            <option value="htg">HTG → USD</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <button class="button" id="calculateButton">Kalkile</button>
        <div class="result" aria-live="polite">
          <p id="resultLabel">Rezilta</p>
          <strong id="result">13,000.00 HTG</strong>
        </div>
        <p class="note" id="rateNote">To 130 la se yon egzanp demonstrasyon, se pa yon to echanj an tan reyèl. Verifye to aktyèl la anvan ou pran desizyon finansye.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="demo">
      <h2 class="section-title" id="demoHeading">Demo finansye</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p id="demoDescription">Sa a se yon demonstrasyon pou aprann. Pa gen lajan reyèl ladan l.</p>
        <p id="demoBalanceLabel">Balans demonstrasyon</p>
        <div class="demo-balance">1,000.00 USD</div>
        <p class="note" id="demoNote">Balans lan se yon egzanp vizyèl sèlman; li pa yon kont labank ni yon depo reyèl.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="learn">
      <h2 class="section-title" id="learnHeading">Aprann finans</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card">
          <h3 id="lesson1Title">1. Konprann echanj</h3>
          <p id="lesson1Text">To echanj la di konbyen yon lajan vo parapò ak yon lòt.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3 id="lesson2Title">2. Planifye bidjè ou</h3>
          <p id="lesson2Text">Konpare revni ou ak depans ou pou pi byen planifye lajan ou.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3 id="lesson3Title">3. Pwoteje tèt ou</h3>
          <p id="lesson3Text">Pa janm pataje modpas ou oswa kòd sekirite ou ak lòt moun.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="account">
      <h2 class="section-title" id="accountHeading">Kont kliyan</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <p id="accountText">Enskripsyon ak verifikasyon idantite pral ajoute avèk yon backend sekirize. Paj sa a poko kreye kont reyèl oswa fè KYC.</p>
        <p class="note" id="securityNote">Pa antre ni voye okenn modpas oswa dokiman idantite nan vèsyon demonstrasyon sa a.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <strong>Jerry Goud e Dola</strong>
    <p id="footerText">Aprann. Kalkile. Pwogrese.</p>
    <small>© 2026 Jerry Goud e Dola — <span id="footerNote">Platfòm edikasyon finansye demonstrasyon.</span></small>
